        "original_id": "c9baefca-0bf3-5618-ad0e-13a538d8e3bf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Joy Formidable, Sixpence None the Richer\n- Songs: A Heavy Abacus\n- Albums: The Big Roar\n- Places: North Wales, London, England, New Braunfels, Texas, Nashville, Tennessee\n\nFacts:\n- The Joy Formidable is a Welsh alternative rock band formed in 2007 in North Wales and now based in London, England.\n- Sixpence None the Richer, also known as Sixpence, is an American alternative Christian rock band that formed in New Braunfels, Texas, and later settled in Nashville, Tennessee.\n- \"A Heavy Abacus\" was released in July 2011 as the fifth and final single from The Joy Formidable's debut album \"The Big Roar.\"",
